flowchart TD
NSGA2_Algorithm["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Population based multi objective optimizer<br/>Sampling crossover mutation selection"]
Decision_Variables["**Decision Variables**<br/>Six buffer capacities<br/>Discrete range {1-10} each"]
BufferCapacityProblem["**Buffer Capacity Problem**<br/>n_var 6 n_obj 2 n_replications configurable<br/>Holds xl xu base_seed n_cores and implements _evaluate"]
Multiprocessing_Pool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Distributes evaluation tasks across cores<br/>Maps evaluate_single_individual over population"]
Evaluate_Individual["**evaluate_single_individual**<br/>Runs n replications per candidate<br/>Aggregates avg WIP and avg throughput as objectives"]
Run_Simulation["**run_simulation**<br/>Executes SimPy production model<br/>Inputs seed and caps returns KPI dictionary"]
DelayBuffer["**DelayBuffer**<br/>Attributes cap delay tokens store in_transit<br/>Methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
Machine["**Machine**<br/>Attributes process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity stats<br/>Methods run breakdown_cycle waiting_energy working_energy"]
Simulation_Results["**Simulation Results**<br/>Throughput WIP produced_parts machine_energy per machine"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>f1 minimize WIP<br/>f2 minimize negative throughput as pymoo requires"]
Optimization_Result["**Optimization Result**<br/>Pareto front history final population and seeds"]
Export_History["**export_history_to_csv**<br/>Serializes generation history variables and KPIs to CSV file"]
Results_CSV["**Results CSV**<br/>File path results/moo_simulation_results.csv for manager review"]
Production_Manager["**Production Manager View**<br/>Consumes CSV KPI table to make capacity decisions"]

